t,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI收紧ChatGPT广告政策，禁止竞品AI生图与音频工具投放</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Mistral AI完成30亿欧元D轮融资，估值突破210亿欧元创欧洲纪录</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">DeepSeek发布V4.1 Flash模型并整合智能模式，V4 Pro将于9月14日下线</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Suno v6 正式上线：支持多模态输入与精准局部编辑功能</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/77255f66b7bdbcf8b20cd8a8b314f1c5.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">AI 音乐生成平台 Suno 正式推出全新一代模型家族 Suno v6，这是其与华纳音乐集团、BMG 及 Believe 等产业合作伙伴共同开发的首个模型系列。v6 包含旗舰模型 v6、探索型 v6-wild 及高效型 v6-mini 三个版本。该模型支持多模态输入，用户可直接上传图片、视频或语音备忘录转化为音乐。核心功能升级在于精准局部编辑，创作者可通过自然语言指令修改特定段落或歌词，无需重新生成整曲，并支持从多首作品中提取元素进行混搭。v6 采用从零训练的新一代架构，显著提升了对人声、乐器及情绪的理解力。目前 Suno v6 已全球推送，旨在为创作者提供从灵感到成品的完整闭环，同时平台明确禁止生成特定知名艺术家的仿作。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI旗舰模型GPT-6 Astra正式接入亚马逊云科技Amazon Bedrock平台</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/97e0da57e2103d5ec8cf42c69e3ccbf6.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI旗舰模型GPT-6 Astra近日正式登陆亚马逊云科技的Amazon Bedrock平台，全球企业客户即日起可通过该平台调用模型。此次接入旨在加速顶级大模型在企业级云服务生态中的落地，支持财务分析、合同审查等复杂业务场景。为保障企业数据安全，Amazon Bedrock提供芯片级零运维人员访问及全流程加密防护。平台明确规定，企业在推理计算过程中产生的数据严禁用于后续模型训练，且无需与OpenAI共享。这种“用完即走、严格隔离”的机制，有效消除了核心数据外泄隐患，为金融、法律等对合规性要求极高的行业扫清了技术采纳障碍，标志着企业级AI市场竞争进一步升级。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI收紧ChatGPT广告政策，禁止竞品AI生图与音频工具投放</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/2cb8beb2512d5a53b38af86ce5743167.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI近期更新广告政策，明确禁止竞争对手在ChatGPT平台内投放图像生成与音频生成类产品的商业广告。Adobe美洲媒体高级总监Doug Wyatt证实，此前参与广告试点的Adobe Firefly等图像生成工具已受限。尽管视频生成类广告仍被允许投放，但OpenAI同步调整了ChatGPT发现机制，停止对图片编辑器及图像生成器等操作性查询返回外部引用链接，切断了第三方工具的自然流量与付费获客渠道。此次调整发生于ChatGPT广告业务上线不足200天之际，目前该业务年化收入运行率已突破10亿美元，OpenAI设定的2026年全年广告收入目标为25亿美元。此举旨在保护其新推出的ChatGPT Images 2.5模型及ChatGPT Live语音功能的市场份额，进一步强化平台生态闭环。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Mistral AI完成30亿欧元D轮融资，估值突破210亿欧元创欧洲纪录</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/0f4300690cd50684397f89db68d9d269.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">欧洲人工智能企业Mistral AI正式完成30亿欧元D轮融资，公司估值达到210亿欧元，刷新欧洲科技公司股权融资规模纪录。本轮资金将重点投入于扩建大规模模型训练与推理算力，并加速下一代核心技术的研发进程。Hugging Face联合创始人Thomas Wolf评价称，这是全球专注于开源模型构建的公司所获得的最大规模股权融资，对开源AI生态具有重要意义。Mistral AI通过此轮融资进一步巩固了其欧洲本土核心AI力量的地位，在保持开源开放路线的同时，持续向全球顶尖模型水平发起冲击。此次融资不仅为公司提供了充足的算力储备，也为行业多元化与技术普惠注入了核心动能，体现了其将模型控制权与所有权交还给用户的技术理念。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">DeepSeek发布V4.1 Flash模型并整合智能模式，V4 Pro将于9月14日下线</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/4befaa55840fa1fc052c06aa0f52589e.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">DeepSeek正式发布V4.1 Flash模型，并宣布将原有的快速、专家及识图模式合而为一，实现智能模式自动切换。该模型具备原生多模态支持，可自动识别查询复杂度并激活视觉能力。V4.1 Flash在性能、速度及成本上全面超越V4 Pro，DeepSeek计划于北京时间2026年9月14日12:00正式下线V4 Pro服务，届时请求将自动路由至V4.1 Flash并按新标准计费。此前，多模态模型DeepSeek-V4-Flash-Vision-Exp已上线API平台，支持Chat Completions、Messages及Responses格式调用。此外，DeepSeek同步调整Flash系列定价，自9月10日12:00起，空闲时段输入缓存命中单价为0.02元，未命中单价1元，输出单价4元；高峰时段价格则为上述</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
